        {
          "name": "Max Element Count",
          "type": "UInt"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "Void",
      "docs": "Call to ensure enough space for some number of solid triangles, is added cumulatively each frame, to make\nit possible for several systems to request a certain number independently.\nIs used to grow the max element count for subsequent frames (as the allocation happens early in the frame).\n@param The number of triangles requested."
    },
